ices, Retail, and Others. It offers Advance Information Marketing System, an enterprise marketing management platform. The company also provides sales and marketing, client relationship management, and outsourced contact center management services. In addition, it offers digital loyalty marketing and management. Further, the company provides outsourced procurement and fulfilment services through local suppliers and mail order programs, including warehousing and distribution services. Additionally, it engages in the retail sale of pharmaceuticals, medical, orthopedic goods, and other food products. Advance Information Marketing Berhad was incorporated in 2004 and is headquartered in Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia.","zh":"Advance Information Marketing Berhad 是一家投资控股公司，在马来西亚和印度尼西亚作为业务流程外包解决方案提供商运营。公司成立于2004年，总部位于马来西亚吉隆坡。","lines":["Managed Customer Loyalty Services：提供客户忠诚度管理服务，包括数字忠诚度营销和管理，以及通过 Advance Information Marketing System 企业营销管理平台提供的服务。","销售与营销服务：提供销售和营销、客户关系管理以及外包联络中心管理服务。","外包采购与履约服务：通过本地供应商和邮购计划提供外包采购和履约服务，包括仓储和分销服务。","零售：从事药品、医疗、骨科产品及其他食品的零售销售。"],"lines_en":["Managed Customer Loyalty Services: Provides customer loyalty management services, including digital loyalty marketing and management, and services through the Advance Information Marketing System enterprise marketing management platform.","Sales and Marketing Services: Offers sales and marketing, client relationship management, and outsourced contact center management services.","Outsourced Procurement and Fulfilment Services: Provides outsourced procurement and fulfilment services through local suppliers and mail order programs, including warehousing and distribution services.","Retail: Engages in the retail sale of pharmaceuticals, medical, orthopedic goods, and other food products."]}}